id: specific-weather-summoning
name: Specific Weather Summoning
restriction: true
reduction: 2
locked:
# Its Battle Weather chosen here; the only one Weather Summoning makes.
choices: cold-weather, earthquake-weather, hot-weather, storm-weather, tornado-weather, vile-weather
weatherFixed: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Weather Summoning makes only the Battle Weather chosen here.
text: >
  Specific Weather Summoning: Your magic can only produce a specific kind of weather.
  –Locked Advancements: N/A
  –TP Cost: -2
  –Effect: Select a Battle Weather. You can only apply your chosen Battle Weather through the effects of Weather
  Summoning.
